    {
      "id": "5594207a-0864-4d75-8f05-0b804e2d64dd",
      "label": "Spells, Weapons & Tools",
      "rows": [
        {
          "columns": [
            {
              "sections": [
                {
                  "id": "64923b13-f2f4-42a8-b95d-83bf65059b6e",
                  "label": "Spells",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "eaa98eae-3b26-496e-a884-278573724a45",
                      "label": "Diplomatic Speech",
                      "type": "Text",
                      "value": "Cost: 1 Mana\nTarget: Self\nDuration: 1 Hour\n\nDraw a glyph in the air before yourself. Until this spell ends you are able to understand all spoken language you can hear as if it were spoken in your native tongue and others who hear you speak will hear your speech in their native tongue. Additionally the glyph will remain suspended in front of you, visible only to you, forming written words in a language you know, translating any written text you run your finger over.",
                      "meta": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "19089272-a4d9-4431-9b2b-47dfea35ce37",
                      "label": "Dispell",
                      "type": "Text",
                      "value": "Cost: 5 + X Mana\nRange: Touch\nTarget: 1 Creature or Object\nDuration: Instant\n\nYou lay your hands upon an enchanted object or creature and channel your focus to deconstruct the spell effecting it. Declare a value for X. If X is greater than the mana cost of the spell affecting the creature or object you end the effects of that spell. If X is lower than the mana cost of the spell, roll 1d20 + X against double the target spell's mana cost. On a success end the spell.",
                      "meta": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "0d8d784d-6a77-4eeb-a3c8-d38d43d90362",
                      "label": "Inspired Strike",
                      "type": "Text",
                      "value": "Cost: 5 Mana\nRange: 24m\nTarget: 1 Creature\nDuration: Instant\nMaterial Cost: Paint, Ink or other Medium Infused with 1 Arc of Dust\n\nThe paint, ink or other medium, gathers in a suspended droplet before you for a moment before darting above your target to form a cloud. Make an accuracy check with panache (1d20 + 3) against your target. On a successful hit the target takes 4d6 lightning damage as a lightning bolt, coloured the hues of it's creator's thoughts, strikes the target.",
                      "meta": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
